terminal.record.1 = Log 1 – Day zero
terminal.record.1.text = Sealed the bunker today. The sirens outside stopped an hour ago. Nobody says what that means. We have air, water and the capsules. That has to be enough.
terminal.record.2 = Maintenance note
terminal.record.2.text = Capsules one to three calibrated. Sleep cycle: indefinite. If the main power fails, the emergency lights run on their own for a very long time. Not forever.
terminal.record.3 = Intercepted transmission
terminal.record.3.text = ...the great gate is failing... whoever can still walk, go through now... we will not come back the same way... [the rest is static]
terminal.record.4 = Personal note
terminal.record.4.text = The steppe used to be green. I keep a handful of seeds in my locker, just in case somebody wakes up and wants to start over.
terminal.record.5 = Last entry
terminal.record.5.text = If you read this, the power is back. That means somebody built it. Good. Start small. The old knowledge will come back, one scroll at a time.

